## Key Business Rules

### FIFO Reports
- Cannot close report before next month starts
- Cannot modify operations in closed months
- Cannot close with zero-price deliveries
- Cannot close with negative balances
- Cannot close with pending operations
- Must have probe reading to close report

### Deliveries
- Acceptance date defaults to delivery date
- Cannot edit/delete deliveries in closed FIFO months
- Acceptance date used for FIFO chronology
- Deliveries don't update tank fuel levels

### Terminals
- Terminal number must be unique
- Maximum 4 tanks per terminal
- Terminal must be initialized before use
- Certificates required for MQTT connection

### Users & Permissions
- Email must be unique per contractor
- Users belong to contractors
- Roles determine permissions
- Admin users have elevated access

